  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Blue Phoenix Tribe, Lu Tong Lan shows Hei Lou Lan her blue phoenix totem. Inside Myriad Beast Fusion Color Heaven, totems are the mainstream way of cultivation and a symbol of strength and status, even though Gu worms are still used. Totems can suit all Gu paths.",
      "chapters": [
        2112
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_blue_phoenix_tribe",
        "char_lu_tong_lan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "loc_myriad_beast_fusion_color_heaven",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the Myriad Tribes Ceremony she instills immortal essence. The totem shines, turns solid, and flies at Stardust Tribe Leader. It dodges a single-horned mountain goat totem, chirps, and spits a torrent of blue flames that encircle the goat until Stardust Tribe Leader admits defeat.",
      "chapters": [
        2114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenge-flight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_myriad_tribes_ceremony"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Upslope Road, when a Predicament appears, she uses her blue phoenix totem with the dark capital strength tiger to defeat it.",
      "chapters": [
        2116
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "predicament-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_upslope_road"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Duan Hu in the eighth layer of Crazed Demon Cave, her blue phoenix totem killer move is almost destroyed. Duan Hu’s attacks are powerful and wild, and colliding feels like colliding with the world itself.",
      "chapters": [
        2165
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "near-defeat-by-duan-hu",
